/-!
# The labelling conjecture for four labels, for every `N`

`bound_of_noLab` with `K = 61`: the left-half-only problem with four labels is infeasible at
`K = 61` (`noLab_L61_4`), and the full problem at `N = 31, …, 60` (`noLab_F31_4`, …); all 31
are kernel-checked LRAT certificates (`Folds/LabellingSAT4Certs{A..H}.lean`, generated by
`experiments/labelling_lrat/make_t4.sh`).

* `admissible_le_four`: an admissible labelling with `t ≤ 4` labels has `N ≤ 2^(t+1) - 2`.
* `lds_exact_le_four`, `descents_exact_le_four`: for semi-symmetric fold sequences,
  `min(⌊log₂(N+1)⌋, 5) ≤ des a + 1` (and `≤ t` for every level labelling with `t` labels,
  e.g. `t = LDS`).
-/

